# Builder Agents Guide

## Commit Message Format

- Subject: `<TICKET>: add <package_name>`
- Body: explain placement and build strategy
- Trailer for combined onboarding: `Relates-to: <TICKET>` (pipeline commit closes)

## Package Placement Rules

- Find active torch collections under `builder/collections/torch-*` where
  `cpu-ubi9/constraints.txt` contains a `torch==` pin
- Default: add to CPU variant (`cpu-ubi9/requirements.txt`) for the highest
  active torch collection
- Only add to CUDA/ROCm if the package depends on an accelerator stack
- Prefer source-based building

## Linting

Run `make linter` before committing. Fix all errors.
